INT. ORBITAL SEED VAULT - GREENHOUSE RING - DAY

Curved walls of white panel. Rows of sealed trays glow violet under grow-lamps. A slow hum, the sound of a place that never sleeps.

ODALYS VANTERPOOL, 50s, station botanist, checks a tray with gloved hands. Her coffee has been cold for hours.

PETRA ISHIGURO, 30s, engineer, kneels at an access panel with a tablet and a mouthful of screws.

CALLUM ROUKEMA, 40s, commander, stands at the viewport. He doesn't look at the Earth below.

MIREILLE TANDON, 20s, intern, carries a tray of seedlings in both hands, like something that might break.

DR. SUNDARAM OKONKWO, 60s, medical officer, leans in the doorway. He watches Callum's back.

KESTREL, a station AI, speaks from a speaker above the door. Calm. Warm. Exact.

KESTREL (V.O.)
Humidity in ring three is up four percent.

ODALYS
I see it.

PETRA
I'll check the condensers.

Callum turns from the window. He walks the row. His fingers brush a leaf. He stops at an empty tray.

CALLUM
This one was labeled.

ODALYS
It failed.

CALLUM
It failed a month ago.

ODALYS
Yes.

MIREILLE
Should I log it?

CALLUM
I did.

Silence. The lamps buzz. Sundaram steps in, hands in his coat pockets.

SUNDARAM
You didn't mention it at breakfast.

CALLUM
Nothing to mention.

SUNDARAM
Callum.

CALLUM
Sundaram.

They both speak at once.

SUNDARAM
The lab results came back.

CALLUM
The cargo window opens Friday.

SUNDARAM ^
It would help if you slept.

CALLUM ^
I'll check the manifest.

Both stop. Neither moves.

Petra, from the floor, pretends to read the tablet. Mireille shifts the seedlings to her other arm.

ODALYS
(not looking up)
Mireille, those need water.

MIREILLE
Right. Yes.

She leaves in a hurry. The door sighs shut.

Sundaram unclasps his hands. Holds something out: a small flat seed packet, yellowed at the edges.

SUNDARAM
Take it.

Callum does not.

SUNDARAM (CONT'D)
It's the last one from the old crop.

Callum takes it. Turns it over. Pockets it.

KESTREL (V.O.)
Commander, a transmission is waiting.

CALLUM
Later.

He walks out. The door seals behind him.

Odalys finally looks up. Petra sets down her screwdriver.

Sundaram sits on an upturned crate. Nobody says anything. The lamps hum on.
